AI assistance was used to suggest debugging steps, and prepare test cases.

## Limitations

This implementation covers the mandatory conversions only. Bonus flags and field widths are not implemented.

The current pointer function prints a null pointer as `0x0`. Null-pointer formatting can vary between systems, so this behavior should be checked against the evaluator's expected output.